\textbf{聖經版本 / Bible Versions}\\
中文經文統一採用和合本（CUV），逐節經 ai-eden.com 或 cnbible.com 核對；各章核對來源詳見附錄二（99-appendix-references.md）逐章說明。\\
Chinese Scripture is uniformly the Chinese Union Version (CUV), verse-by-verse verified against ai-eden.com or cnbible.com; see the references appendix for the exact per-chapter verification source.\\
English: English Standard Version (ESV)\\[0.8em]

\textbf{主要參考資料 / Primary Sources}\\
\textbullet\ 老弟兄查經方法論與框架之應用（本書無對應之老弟兄彼得前書逐節查經筆記原始記錄；詳見附錄二誠實說明）\\
\textbullet\ John MacArthur - MacArthur New Testament Commentary (gty.org)\\
\textbullet\ G. Campbell Morgan\\[0.8em]

\textbf{核心主題 / Central Theme}\\
彼得寫給散居各處、正經歷逼迫的客旅，教導他們如何在苦難中持守活潑的盼望——因基督已經受苦在先，又已經得著榮耀。\\
Peter's letter to scattered, persecuted sojourners --- teaching them to hold a living hope through suffering, because Christ has already suffered first, and already been glorified.\\[0.8em]

本書為三書精讀項目成果之一。\\
Part of the Three Books Deep Reading Project.
$endif$

\end{flushleft}
